    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Allergy:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " most pts who report PCN allergy don't rxt on re-exposure; risk = ~10x higher after a prior rxn. Hx of anaphylaxis to PCN: ⍉other PCNs or beta-lactams w similar side chains (except rarely, w desensitization in a controlled setting)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
